Act II: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Ariel]
Prospero:
 You are as good as Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big hero and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Lady Macbeth.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

